  "Html": "<div><html>\r\n\r\n<head>\r\n<meta name=Generator content=\"Microsoft Office HTML Filter 2.0\">\r\n<meta http-equiv=Content-Type content=\"text/html; charset=windows-1252\">\r\n<style>\r\n<!--\r\n \r\n-->\r\n</style>\r\n\r\n</head>\r\n\r\n<body lang=EN-US>\r\n\r\n<div>\r\n\r\n<p align=center><b>CHAPTER 67:46:03</b></p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<p align=center><b>LONG-TERM CARE\r\nELIGIBILITY</b></p>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>Section</p>\r\n\r\n<p><a href=\"DisplayRule.aspx?Rule=67:46:03:01\">67:46:03:01</a>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Responsibility\r\nfor information.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><a href=\"DisplayRule.aspx?Rule=67:46:03:02\">67:46:03:02</a>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Aged,\r\nblind, or disabled.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><a href=\"DisplayRule.aspx?Rule=67:46:03:03\">67:46:03:03</a>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Long-term\r\ncare residency requirement and beginning of eligibility.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><a href=\"DisplayRule.aspx?Rule=67:46:03:04\">67:46:03:04</a>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Transferred.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><a href=\"DisplayRule.aspx?Rule=67:46:03:05\">67:46:03:05</a>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Transferred.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><a href=\"DisplayRule.aspx?Rule=67:46:03:06\">67:46:03:06</a>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Transferred.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><a href=\"DisplayRule.aspx?Rule=67:46:03:07\">67:46:03:07</a>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Transferred.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><a href=\"DisplayRule.aspx?Rule=67:46:03:08\">67:46:03:08</a>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Transferred.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><a href=\"DisplayRule.aspx?Rule=67:46:03:09\">67:46:03:09</a>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Transferred.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><a href=\"DisplayRule.aspx?Rule=67:46:03:10\">67:46:03:10</a>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Transferred.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><a href=\"DisplayRule.aspx?Rule=67:46:03:11\">67:46:03:11</a>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Transferred.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><a href=\"DisplayRule.aspx?Rule=67:46:03:12\">67:46:03:12</a>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Transferred.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><a href=\"DisplayRule.aspx?Rule=67:46:03:13\">67:46:03:13</a>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Transferred.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><a href=\"DisplayRule.aspx?Rule=67:46:03:14\">67:46:03:14</a>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Transferred.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><a href=\"DisplayRule.aspx?Rule=67:46:03:15\">67:46:03:15</a>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Transferred.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><a href=\"DisplayRule.aspx?Rule=67:46:03:16\">67:46:03:16</a>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Repealed.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><a href=\"DisplayRule.aspx?Rule=67:46:03:17\">67:46:03:17</a>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Repealed.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><a href=\"DisplayRule.aspx?Rule=67:46:03:18\">67:46:03:18</a>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Determination\r\nof disability.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><a href=\"DisplayRule.aspx?Rule=67:46:03:19\">67:46:03:19</a>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Determination\r\nof blindness.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><a href=\"DisplayRule.aspx?Rule=67:46:03:20\">67:46:03:20</a>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Cessation\r\nof determination of blindness.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><a href=\"DisplayRule.aspx?Rule=67:46:03:21\">67:46:03:21</a>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Cessation\r\nof disability.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><a href=\"DisplayRule.aspx?Rule=67:46:03:22\">67:46:03:22</a>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Release\r\nof medical information.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><a href=\"DisplayRule.aspx?Rule=67:46:03:23\">67:46:03:23</a>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Payment\r\nfor examinations.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><a href=\"DisplayRule.aspx?Rule=67:46:03:24\">67:46:03:24</a>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Repealed.</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n</body>\r\n\r\n</html>\r\n</div><br /><hr><br /><div><html>\r\n\r\n<head>\r\n<title>Rule 67:46:03:01 Responsibility for information.</title>\r\n<META NAME=\"Keywords\" Content=\"Administrative Rules 67:46:03:01\">\r\n<META NAME=\"Description\" Content=\"Administrative Rules 67:46:03:01 Responsibility for information.\">\r\n<meta name=Generator content=\"Microsoft Office HTML Filter 2.0\">\r\n<meta http-equiv=Content-Type content=\"text/html; charset=windows-1252\">\r\n<meta name=Originator content=\"Microsoft Word 10\">\r\n<style>\r\n<!--\r\n \r\n-->\r\n</style>\r\n</head>\r\n\r\n<body lang=EN-US>\r\n\r\n<div>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; <b>67:46:03:01.&nbsp;&nbsp;Responsibility\r\nfor information.</b> The applicant or recipient of long-term care shall have\r\nthe primary responsibility of furnishing the department information necessary\r\nto determine eligibility or ineligibility for long-term care assistance. Failure\r\nof the applicant or recipient to furnish the necessary information may result\r\nin the rejection or termination of long-term care assistance.</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; <b>Source:</b>\r\n2 SDR 74, effective May 13, 1976; 7 SDR 66, 7 SDR 89, effective July 1, 1981; 8\r\nSDR 170, effective June 21, 1982; transferred from §&nbsp;67:16:18:01,\r\neffective August 23, 1992.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; <b>General\r\nAuthority:</b> SDCL <A HREF=\"/statutes/DisplayStatute.aspx?Type=Statute&Statute=28-6-1\">28-6-1.</A></p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; <b>Law\r\nImplemented:</b> SDCL <A HREF=\"/statutes/DisplayStatute.aspx?Type=Statute&Statute=28-6-1\">28-6-1</A>, <A HREF=\"/statutes/DisplayStatute.aspx?Type=Statute&Statute=28-6-5\">28-6-5.</A></p>\r\n\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n</body>\r\n\r\n</html>\r\n</div><br /><hr><br /><div><html>\r\n\r\n<head>\r\n<title>Rule 67:46:03:02 Aged, blind, or disabled.</title>\r\n<META NAME=\"Keywords\" Content=\"Administrative Rules 67:46:03:02\">\r\n<META NAME=\"Description\" Content=\"Administrative Rules 67:46:03:02 Aged, blind, or disabled.\">\r\n<meta name=Generator content=\"Microsoft Office HTML Filter 2.0\">\r\n<meta http-equiv=Content-Type content=\"text/html; charset=windows-1252\">\r\n<meta name=Originator content=\"Microsoft Word 10\">\r\n<style>\r\n<!--\r\n \r\n-->\r\n</style>\r\n</head>\r\n\r\n<body lang=EN-US>\r\n\r\n<div>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; <b>67:46:03:02.&nbsp;&nbsp;Aged, blind, or disabled.</b> Long-term care\r\nassistance shall be provided to an eligible aged, blind, or disabled applicant\r\nor recipient meeting one of the following:</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; (1)&nbsp;&nbsp;The individual is at\r\nleast 65 years of age at the time of application;</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; (2)&nbsp;&nbsp;The individual has a\r\ncentral visual acuity of 20/200 or less in the better eye with the use of a\r\ncorrecting lens;</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; (3)&nbsp;&nbsp;The individual has\r\nlimited vision: the widest diameter of the visual field subtends an angle no\r\ngreater than 20 degrees;</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; (4)&nbsp;&nbsp;The individual is\r\nunable to engage in substantial gainful activity because of a physical or\r\nmental impairment which can be expected to result in death or which has lasted\r\nor can be expected to last for a continuous period of at least 12 months; or</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; (5)&nbsp;&nbsp;The individual is a\r\nchild under 18 years of age who is unable to engage in substantial gainful\r\nactivity because of a mental or physical impairment which can be expected to\r\nresult in death or which has lasted or can be expected to last for a continuous\r\nperiod of at least 12 months.</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; <b>Source:</b>\r\n2 SDR 74, effective May 13, 1976; 7 SDR 66, 7 SDR 89, effective July 1, 1981; 8\r\nSDR 170, effective June 21, 1982; transferred from §&nbsp;67:16:18:02,\r\neffective August 23, 1992.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; <b>General\r\nAuthority:</b> SDCL <A HREF=\"/statutes/DisplayStatute.aspx?Type=Statute&Statute=28-6-1\">28-6-1.</A></p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; <b>Law\r\nImplemented:</b> SDCL <A HREF=\"/statutes/DisplayStatute.aspx?Type=Statute&Statute=28-6-1\">28-6-1.</A></p>\r\n\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n</body>\r\n\r\n</html>\r\n</div><br /><hr><br /><div><html>\r\n\r\n<head>\r\n<title>Rule 67:46:03:03 Long-term care residency requirement and beginning of eligibility.</title>\r\n<META NAME=\"Keywords\" Content=\"Administrative Rules 67:46:03:03\">\r\n<META NAME=\"Description\" Content=\"Administrative Rules 67:46:03:03 Long-term care residency requirement and beginning of eligibility.\">\r\n<meta name=Generator content=\"Microsoft Office HTML Filter 2.0\">\r\n<meta http-equiv=Content-Type content=\"text/html; charset=windows-1252\">\r\n<meta name=Originator content=\"Microsoft Word 10\">\r\n<style>\r\n<!--\r\n \r\n-->\r\n</style>\r\n</head>\r\n\r\n<body lang=EN-US>\r\n\r\n<div>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; <b>67:46:03:03.&nbsp;&nbsp;Long-term care residency requirement and\r\nbeginning of eligibility.</b> The department shall approve long-term care\r\nassistance or medical services for an eligible individual if the individual is\r\nparticipating in a home and community-based service program or resides in one\r\nof the following facilities:</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; (1)&nbsp;&nbsp;A licensed hospital,\r\nnursing facility, intermediate care facility, or assisted living facility that\r\nhas a Medicaid provider agreement with the department for the level of care and\r\nservices provided; or</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; (2)&nbsp;&nbsp;An adult foster care\r\nfacility licensed by the South Dakota Department of Health.</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; If an eligible individual's income\r\nminus $20 is less than the SSI standard, long-term care assistance or medical\r\nassistance begins in the month the person enters the facility, subject to §&nbsp;67:46:01:03.</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; If an eligible individual's income\r\nminus $20 is greater than the SSI standard but does not exceed 300 percent of\r\nthe SSI standard, long-term care assistance or medical assistance begins the\r\nfirst day of a 30-consecutive-day period of institutionalization, subject to\r\n§&nbsp;67:46:01:03. The 30-consecutive-day period is met if the requirements of\r\nthis rule are met and the individual dies before the 30<sup>th</sup>\r\nconsecutive day.</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; <b>Source:</b>\r\n2 SDR 74, effective May 13, 1976; 7 SDR 66, 7 SDR 89, effective July 1, 1981; 8\r\nSDR 170, effective June 21, 1982; 10 SDR 79, effective February 1, 1984; 15 SDR\r\n2, effective July 17, 1988; transferred from §&nbsp;67:16:18:03, effective\r\nAugust 23, 1992; 19 SDR 141, effective March 25, 1993; 20 SDR 92, effective\r\nDecember 21, 1993; 30 SDR 193, effective June 13, 2004.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; <b>General\r\nAuthority:</b> SDCL <A HREF=\"/statutes/DisplayStatute.aspx?Type=Statute&Statute=28-6-1\">28-6-1.</A></p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; <b>Law\r\nImplemented:</b> SDCL <A HREF=\"/statutes/DisplayStatute.aspx?Type=Statute&Statute=28-6-1\">28-6-1.</A></p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; <b>Cross-References:</b></p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Home and community-based services, ch 67:54:04.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Home and community-based waiver\r\nservices, ch 67:44:03.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; SSI standard benefit amount,\r\nsubdivision 67:46:04:13(2).</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n</body>\r\n\r\n</html>\r\n</div><br /><hr><br /><div><html>\r\n\r\n<head>\r\n<title>Rule 67:46:03:04 Transferred.</title>\r\n<META NAME=\"Keywords\" Content=\"Administrative Rules 67:46:03:04\">\r\n<META NAME=\"Description\" Content=\"Administrative Rules 67:46:03:04 Transferred.\">\r\n<meta http-equiv=Content-Type content=\"text/html; charset=windows-1252\">\r\n<meta name=Generator content=\"Microsoft Word 14 (filtered)\">\r\n<style>\r\n<!--\r\n /* Font Definitions */\r\n @font-face\r\n\t{font-family:Calibri;\r\n\tpanose-1:2 15 5 2 2 2 4 3 2 4;}\r\n /* Style Definitions */\r\n p.MsoNormal, li.MsoNormal, div.MsoNormal\r\n\t{margin:0in;\r\n\tmargin-bottom:.0001pt;\r\n\ttext-align:justify;\r\n\tfont-size:12.0pt;\r\n\tfont-family:\"Times New Roman\",\"serif\";}\r\n@page WordSection1\r\n\t{size:8.5in 11.0in;\r\n\tmargin:1.0in 1.0in 1.0in 1.0in;}\r\ndiv.WordSection1\r\n\t{page:WordSection1;}\r\n-->\r\n</style>\r\n\r\n</head>\r\n\r\n<body lang=EN-US>\r\n\r\n<div class=WordSection1>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; <b>67:46:03:04.&nbsp;&nbsp;Transferred to\r\n&#167;&nbsp;67:46:01:17.</b></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n</body>\r\n\r\n</html>\r\n</div><br /><hr><br /><div><html>\r\n\r\n<head>\r\n<title>Rule 67:46:03:05 Transferred.</title>\r\n<META NAME=\"Keywords\" Content=\"Administrative Rules 67:46:03:05\">\r\n<META NAME=\"Description\" Content=\"Administrative Rules 67:46:03:05 Transferred.\">\r\n<meta http-equiv=Content-Type content=\"text/html; charset=windows-1252\">\r\n<meta name=Generator content=\"Microsoft Word 14 (filtered)\">\r\n<style>\r\n<!--\r\n /* Font Definitions */\r\n @font-face\r\n\t{font-family:Calibri;\r\n\tpanose-1:2 15 5 2 2 2 4 