>\r\n<META NAME=\"Keywords\" Content=\"Administrative Rules 67:46:03:17\">\r\n<META NAME=\"Description\" Content=\"Administrative Rules 67:46:03:17 Repealed.\">\r\n<meta name=Generator content=\"Microsoft Office HTML Filter 2.0\">\r\n<meta http-equiv=Content-Type content=\"text/html; charset=windows-1252\">\r\n<meta name=Originator content=\"Microsoft Word 10\">\r\n<style>\r\n<!--\r\n \r\n-->\r\n</style>\r\n</head>\r\n\r\n<body lang=EN-US>\r\n\r\n<div>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; <b>67:46:03:17.&nbsp;&nbsp;Social security numbers.</b>Repealed.</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; <b>Source:</b>\r\n2 SDR 74, effective May 13, 1976; 7 SDR 66, 7 SDR 89, effective July 1, 1981; 8\r\nSDR 170, effective June 21, 1982; 12 SDR 6, effective July 28, 1985;\r\ntransferred from §&nbsp;67:16:18:07, effective August 23, 1992; repealed, 24\r\nSDR 24, effective August 31, 1997.</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n</body>\r\n\r\n</html>\r\n</div><br /><hr><br /><div><html>\r\n\r\n<head>\r\n<title>Rule 67:46:03:18 Determination of disability.</title>\r\n<META NAME=\"Keywords\" Content=\"Administrative Rules 67:46:03:18\">\r\n<META NAME=\"Description\" Content=\"Administrative Rules 67:46:03:18 Determination of disability.\">\r\n<meta http-equiv=Content-Type content=\"text/html; charset=windows-1252\">\r\n<meta name=Generator content=\"Microsoft Word 14 (filtered)\">\r\n<style>\r\n<!--\r\n /* Font Definitions */\r\n @font-face\r\n\t{font-family:Calibri;\r\n\tpanose-1:2 15 5 2 2 2 4 3 2 4;}\r\n /* Style Definitions */\r\n p.MsoNormal, li.MsoNormal, div.MsoNormal\r\n\t{margin:0in;\r\n\tmargin-bottom:.0001pt;\r\n\ttext-align:justify;\r\n\tfont-size:12.0pt;\r\n\tfont-family:\"Times New Roman\",\"serif\";}\r\n@page WordSection1\r\n\t{size:8.5in 11.0in;\r\n\tmargin:1.0in 1.0in 1.0in 1.0in;}\r\ndiv.WordSection1\r\n\t{page:WordSection1;}\r\n-->\r\n</style>\r\n\r\n</head>\r\n\r\n<body lang=EN-US>\r\n\r\n<div class=WordSection1>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; <b>67:46:03:18.&nbsp;&nbsp;Determination of\r\ndisability.</b> The disability/incapacity consultation team shall determine\r\ndisability following the guidelines for the SSI program provided in 42 U.S.C.\r\n&#167;&#167;&nbsp;1382c(a)(3)(A) to 1382c(a)(3)(C), inclusive, as of July 1, 2014, based on\r\nmedical evidence supplemented by a social history. Medical evidence may be a\r\nphysician's report, a copy of the physician's records, or the findings of a\r\nphysical examination completed for this purpose. An individual who is receiving\r\nsocial security or SSI disability benefits meets the long-term care assistance\r\ndisability requirements.</p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; <b>Source:</b> 2 SDR 74, effective May 13, 1976; 7\r\nSDR 66, 7 SDR 89, effective July 1, 1981; 8 SDR 170, effective June 21, 1982;\r\n18 SDR 67, effective October 13, 1991; transferred from &#167;&nbsp;67:16:18:08,\r\neffective August 23, 1992; 21 SDR 162, effective March 23, 1995; 41 SDR 93,\r\neffective December 3, 2014.</p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; <b>General Authority:</b> SDCL <A HREF=\"/statutes/DisplayStatute.aspx?Type=Statute&Statute=28-6-1\">28-6-1.</A></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; <b>Law Implemented:</b> SDCL <A HREF=\"/statutes/DisplayStatute.aspx?Type=Statute&Statute=28-6-1\">28-6-1.</A></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n</body>\r\n\r\n</html>\r\n</div><br /><hr><br /><div><html>\r\n\r\n<head>\r\n<title>Rule 67:46:03:19 Determination of blindness.</title>\r\n<META NAME=\"Keywords\" Content=\"Administrative Rules 67:46:03:19\">\r\n<META NAME=\"Description\" Content=\"Administrative Rules 67:46:03:19 Determination of blindness.\">\r\n<meta name=Generator content=\"Microsoft Office HTML Filter 2.0\">\r\n<meta http-equiv=Content-Type content=\"text/html; charset=windows-1252\">\r\n<meta name=Originator content=\"Microsoft Word 10\">\r\n<style>\r\n<!--\r\n \r\n-->\r\n</style>\r\n</head>\r\n\r\n<body lang=EN-US>\r\n\r\n<div>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; <b>67:46:03:19.&nbsp;&nbsp;Determination of blindness.</b> Blindness,\r\naccording to §&nbsp;67:46:03:02, shall be determined\r\nby an ophthalmologist designated by the department. Based on an ophthalmologist's or optometrist's report and evaluation,\r\nthe ophthalmologist shall determine whether the disability requires long-term\r\ncare. If the individual is receiving social security disability benefits or SSI\r\nbenefits based on blindness, the individual is considered to meet the blindness\r\nrequirements for long-term care assistance.</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; <b>Source:</b>\r\n2 SDR 74, effective May 13, 1976; 7 SDR 66, 7 SDR 89, effective July 1, 1981; 8\r\nSDR 170, effective June 21, 1982; transferred from §&nbsp;67:16:18:09,\r\neffective August 23, 1992.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; <b>General\r\nAuthority:</b> SDCL <A HREF=\"/statutes/DisplayStatute.aspx?Type=Statute&Statute=28-6-1\">28-6-1.</A></p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; <b>Law\r\nImplemented:</b> SDCL <A HREF=\"/statutes/DisplayStatute.aspx?Type=Statute&Statute=28-6-1\">28-6-1.</A></p>\r\n\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n</body>\r\n\r\n</html>\r\n</div><br /><hr><br /><div><html>\r\n\r\n<head>\r\n<title>Rule 67:46:03:20 Cessation of determination of blindness.</title>\r\n<META NAME=\"Keywords\" Content=\"Administrative Rules 67:46:03:20\">\r\n<META NAME=\"Description\" Content=\"Administrative Rules 67:46:03:20 Cessation of determination of blindness.\">\r\n<meta name=Generator content=\"Microsoft Office HTML Filter 2.0\">\r\n<meta http-equiv=Content-Type content=\"text/html; charset=windows-1252\">\r\n<meta name=Originator content=\"Microsoft Word 10\">\r\n<style>\r\n<!--\r\n \r\n-->\r\n</style>\r\n</head>\r\n\r\n<body lang=EN-US>\r\n\r\n<div>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; <b>67:46:03:20&nbsp;&nbsp;Cessation of determination of blindness.</b> An\r\nindividual shall be ineligible for long-term care assistance when either of the\r\nfollowing occurs:</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; (1)&nbsp;&nbsp;The individual has\r\napplied for and has been denied social security disability or SSI benefits\r\nbased on blindness; or</p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; (2)&nbsp;&nbsp;The department has\r\ndetermined that the blindness does not require long-term care.</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; If an individual is ineligible based\r\non subdivision (1), the department may not overrule the decision.</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; <b>Source:</b>\r\n8 SDR 170, effective June 21, 1982; transferred from §&nbsp;67:16:18:09.01,\r\neffective August 23, 1992.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; <b>General\r\nAuthority:</b> SDCL <A HREF=\"/statutes/DisplayStatute.aspx?Type=Statute&Statute=28-6-1\">28-6-1.</A></p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; <b>Law\r\nImplemented:</b> SDCL <A HREF=\"/statutes/DisplayStatute.aspx?Type=Statute&Statute=28-6-1\">28-6-1.</A></p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; <b>Cross-Reference:</b>\r\nDetermination of blindness, §&nbsp;67:46:03:19.</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n</body>\r\n\r\n</html>\r\n</div><br /><hr><br /><div><html>\r\n\r\n<head>\r\n<title>Rule 67:46:03:21 Cessation of disability.</title>\r\n<META NAME=\"Keywords\" Content=\"Administrative Rules 67:46:03:21\">\r\n<META NAME=\"Description\" Content=\"Administrative Rules 67:46:03:21 Cessation of disability.\">\r\n<meta name=Generator content=\"Microsoft Office HTML Filter 2.0\">\r\n<meta http-equiv=Content-Type content=\"text/html; charset=windows-1252\">\r\n<meta name=Originator content=\"Microsoft Word 10\">\r\n<style>\r\n<!--\r\n \r\n-->\r\n</style>\r\n</head>\r\n\r\n<body lang=EN-US>\r\n\r\n<div>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; <b>67:46:03:21.&nbsp;&nbsp;Cessation of disability.</b> An individual is\r\nineligible for long-term care assistance when either of the following occurs:</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; (1)&nbsp;&nbsp;The\r\ndisability/incapacity consultation team, following §67:46:03:18,\r\ninclusive, determines that a disability ceases to exist; or</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; (2)&nbsp;&nbsp;The individual has been\r\ndenied social security or SSI disability benefits based on a disability.</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; If an individual is ineligible based\r\non subdivision (2) of this section, the department may not overrule the\r\ndecision.</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; <b>Source:</b>\r\n2 SDR 74, effective May 13, 1976; 7 SDR 66, 7 SDR 89, effective July 1, 1981; 8\r\nSDR 170, effective June 21, 1982; 18 SDR 67, effective October 13, 1991;\r\ntransferred from §&nbsp;67:16:18:10, effective August 23, 1992; 21 SDR 162,\r\neffective March 23, 1995.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; <b>General\r\nAuthority:</b> SDCL <A HREF=\"/statutes/DisplayStatute.aspx?Type=Statute&Statute=28-6-1\">28-6-1.</A></p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; <b>Law\r\nImplemented:</b> SDCL <A HREF=\"/statutes/DisplayStatute.aspx?Type=Statute&Statute=28-6-1\">28-6-1.</A></p>\r\n\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n</body>\r\n\r\n</html>\r\n</div><br /><hr><br /><div><html>\r\n\r\n<head>\r\n<title>Rule 67:46:03:22 Release of medical information.</title>\r\n<META NAME=\"Keywords\" Content=\"Administrative Rules 67:46:03:22\">\r\n<META NAME=\"Description\" Content=\"Administrative Rules 67:46:03:22 Release of medical information.\">\r\n<meta name=Generator content=\"Microsoft Office HTML Filter 2.0\">\r\n<meta http-equiv=Content-Type content=\"text/html; charset=windows-1252\">\r\n<meta name=Originator content=\"Microsoft Word 10\">\r\n<style>\r\n<!--\r\n \r\n-->\r\n</style>\r\n</head>\r\n\r\n<body lang=EN-US>\r\n\r\n<div>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; <b>67:46:03:22.&nbsp;&nbsp;Release of medical information.</b> No medical\r\ninformation may be obtained unless the department secures the applicant's\r\nwritten consent. Refusal to sign an authorization for the release of this\r\ninformation shall make the applicant ineligible for long-term care assistance.</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; <b>Source:</b>\r\n2 SDR 74, effective May 13, 1976; 7 SDR 66, 7 SDR 89, effective July 1, 1981; 8\r\nSDR 170, effective June 21, 1982; transferred from §&nbsp;67:16:18:11,\r\neffective August 23, 1992.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; <b>General\r\nAuthority:</b> SDCL <A HREF=\"/statutes/DisplayStatute.aspx?Type=Statute&Statute=28-6-1\">28-6-1.</A></p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; <b>Law\r\nImplemented:</b> SDCL <A HREF=\"/statutes/DisplayStatute.aspx?Type=Statute&Statute=28-6-1\">28-6-1.</A></p>\r\n\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n</body>\r\n\r\n</html>\r\n</div><br /><hr><br /><div><html>\r\n\r\n<head>\r\n<title>Rule 67:46:03:23 Payment for examinations.</title>\r\n<META NAME=\"Keywords\" Content=\"Administrative Rules 67:46:03:23\">\r\n<META NAME=\"Description\" Content=\"Administrative Rules 67:46:03:23 Payment for examinations.\">\r\n<meta name=Generator content=\"Microsoft Office HTML Filter 2.0\">\r\n<meta http-equiv=Content-Type content=\"text/html; charset=windows-1252\">\r\n<meta name=Originator content=\"Microsoft Word 10\">\r\n<style>\r\n<!--\r\n \r\n-->\r\n</style>\r\n</head>\r\n\r\n<body lang=EN-US>\r\n\r\n<div>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; <b>67:46:03:23.&nbsp;&nbsp;Payment for examinations.</b> Physical\r\nexaminations requested by the department for the purpose of determining an\r\napplicant's or recipient's eligibility and level of care shall be paid for by\r\nthe department in accordance with §§&nbsp;67:16:01:09 and 67:16:01:11. The\r\napplicant or recipient shall obtain written authorization for the examination\r\nfrom the department and shall present the authorization to the person\r\nconducting the examination.</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; <b>Source:</b>\r\n2 SDR 74, effective May 13, 1976; 7 SDR 66, 7 SDR 89, effective July 1, 1981; 8\r\nSDR 170, effective June 21, 1982; transferred from §&nbsp;67:16:18:12,\r\neffective August 23, 1992.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; <b>General\r\nAuthority:</b> SDCL <A HREF=\"/statutes/DisplayStatute.aspx?Type=Statute&Statute=28-6-1\">28-6-1.</A></p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; <b>Law\r\nImplemented:</b> SDCL <A HREF=\"/statutes/DisplayStatute.aspx?Type=Statute&Statute=28-6-1\">28-6-1.</A></p>\r\n\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n</body>\r\n\r\n</html>\r\n</div><br /><hr><br /><div><html>\r\n\r\n<head>\r\n<title>Rule 67:46:03:24 Repealed.</title>\r\n<META NAME=\"Keywords\" Content=\"Administrative Rules 67:46:03:24\">\r\n<META NAME=\"Description\" Content=\"Administrative Rules 67:46:03:24 Repealed.\">\r\n<meta http-equiv=Content-Type content=\"text/html; charset=windows-1252\">\r\n<meta name=Generator content=\"Microsoft Word 14 (filtered)\">\r\n<style>\r\n<!--\r\n /* Font Definitions */\r\n @font-face\r\n\t{font-family:Calibri;\r\n\tpanose-1:2 15 5 2 2 2 4 3 2 4;}\r\n /* Style Definitions */\r\n p.MsoNormal, li.MsoNormal, div.MsoNormal\r\n\t{margin:0in;\r\n\tmargin-bottom:.0001pt;\r\n\ttext-align:justify;\r\n\tfont-size:12.0pt;\r\n\tfont-family:\"Times New Roman\",\"serif\";}\r\n@page WordSection1\r\n\t{size:8.5in 11.0in;\r\n\tmargin:1.0in 1.0in 1.0in 1.0in;}\r\ndiv.WordSection1\r\n\t{page:WordSection1;}\r\n-->\r\n</style>\r\n\r\n</head>\r\n\r\n<body lang=EN-US>\r\n\r\n<div class=WordSection1>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; <b>67:46:03:24.&nbsp;&nbsp;Absence of regulations\r\nregarding conditions of eligibility.</b> Repealed.</p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; <b>Source:</b> 8 SDR 170, effective June 21, 1982;\r\ntransferred from &#167;&nbsp;67:16:18:15, effective August 23, 1992; repealed, 41\r\nSDR 93, effective December 3, 2014.</p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal align=left style='text-align:left'>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n</body>\r\n\r\n</html>\r\n</div>",
